## 8. Approval thresholds (Action Queue)

What can be auto-approved vs requires a human.

- **L1 — auto-approvable (bulk OK)**: Negative keywords with <$50 wasted spend, asset pause for <0.5% CTR after 30 days, budget shifts under 10%.
- **L2 — single human approval**: Budget shifts 10–25%, RSA asset rotation, conversion action edits, geo/schedule changes.
- **L3 — MFA + human approval**: Campaign pause, bid strategy change, structure change (new campaign / merge / split), broad-match enablement, conversion action created/removed.

